averon{"id":779,"date":"2023-01-26T14:40:28","date_gmt":"2023-01-26T14:40:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/business-banking\/digital-banking\/order-checks\/"},"modified":"2023-02-27T18:57:48","modified_gmt":"2023-02-27T18:57:48","slug":"order-checks","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/business-banking\/digital-banking\/order-checks\/","title":{"rendered":"Order Checks"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<h1>Order business checks<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p>Averon Trust Bank has partnered with Harland Clarke to enable you to order your personal and business checks and accessories online.&nbsp;Choose from a wide variety of check styles, options and accessories to suit your personality and the manner in which you manage your finances.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ordermychecks.com\/login_a.jsp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Harland Clarke<\/a> representatives are available to assist you 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. Call toll-free, <a href=\"tel:1-800-275-1053\">1-800-275-1053<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>When ordering checks online:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Enter your account number and the Averon Trust Bank routing and transit number: 211173357.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Upon submitting your order, the purchase amount will be charged directly to your account and your purchase will be shipped to the address that appears on the online check order.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Need to make changes?<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>You may change the check style and\/or the starting check number when ordering.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>If you need to change the name or address on your check order or to have your checks delivered to an alternate address, please contact our <a href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/contact\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Customer Care Center<\/a> at <a href=\"tel:678-465-8306\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">678-465-8306<\/a> during normal business hours.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-btn-secondary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/www.ordermychecks.com\/login_a.jsp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">place your order<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Order business checks Averon Trust Bank has partnered with Harland Clarke to enable you to order your personal and business checks and accessories online.&nbsp;Choose from a wide variety of check styles, options and accessories to suit your personality and the manner in which you manage your finances. Harland Clarke representatives are available to assist you&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":109,"menu_order":5,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"service-page.blade.php","meta":[],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v20.1 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Order Business Checks | Averon Trust Bank<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Averon Trust Bank has partnered with Harland Clarke to enable you to order your personal and business checks and accessories online.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/business-banking\/digital-banking\/order-checks\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Order Business Checks | Averon Trust Bank\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Averon Trust Bank has partnered with Harland Clarke to enable you to order your personal and business checks and accessories online.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/chelseagroton.com\/business-banking\/digital-banking\/order-che